quests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you make an offer, you offer to do something. <BR> <span class=\"italic\">Example: Can I carry that for you?</span> <br><br> When you make a suggestion, you give ideas or ways to do something.<br> <span class=\"italic\">Example: We could go to the supermarket first.</span> <br><br> When you make a request, you ask someone for help or to do something.<br><span class=\"italic\">Example: Could you help me?</span> "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ask\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ask\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Respond\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offer\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I book you the complete package?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, I'd like that.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Suggest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How about a pedicure?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">That sounds good.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I get  a manicure?</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Certainly.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Zero Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the zero  conditional when the result is always the same. <bR><BR>It's a generalization or a fact. <br><br>The 'if' in this conditional can usually be replaced by 'when' without changing the meaning."}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you want to relax, choose Day of Rest. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "When you book a full day, you get lunch."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to look your best"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to look as good as you can"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's her first date with Tom and she wants to look her best."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about a spa. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "complete"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "whole; entire"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to book the complete package."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wax"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a material used to make candles or in spa treatments  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She always has a hot wax treatment on her hands at the spa."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pedicure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a treatment for the feet and toenails "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They get pedicures in the hot season when they wear sandals."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "manicure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a treatment for the hands and nails "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She get a manicure every week so her hands look nice."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "skin"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the layer that covers our bodies"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Her skin is the colour of milk."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le10ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a short dialogue (5-6 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Request a service."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The receptionist offers help and gives choices."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You accept the offers."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the dialogue with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write about a hotel service."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make requests for information about a service."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make and accept offers."}]}], "type": "sena"}